      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.36.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Esau took his wives of the daughters of Canaan; Adah the daughter of Elon the Hittite, and Aholibamah the daughter of Anah the daughter of Zibeon the Hivite;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.36.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.36.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Bashemath, Ishmael's daughter, sister of Nebajoth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.36.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.36.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Adah bore to Esau, Eliphaz; and Bashemath bore Reuel;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.36.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.36.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Aholibamah bore Jeush, and Jaalam, and Korah: These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Esau, who were born to him in the land of Canaan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
